naries only actual path,size,unknown SHA,not archival payload reads/hashes. Snapshot small source dependencies/logs/receipts,not standalone complete workspace. Original recorder once,inmemory sparse-add adapter only,own branch+annotated tag atomic nonforce push. Historical PH12 remains pending; postpush receipt not another archive stage.\n",
